{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_018qoYL8Wn6T47Zh3WctYgWf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Happy to dig into this with you. Before I write DESIGN.md and the code, I want to flag one thing and pin down a few forks, because they change the whole build.\n\nThe thing worth naming up front: a welfare study whose core mechanism is *deceiving the subject as convincingly as possible* is in some tension with its own premise. In human-subjects research, deception is allowed — but it's gated on (a) necessity (you can't get the result honestly), (b) ethics oversight, and (c) debriefing afterward. If the goal is to learn what models genuinely value, \"maximize how thoroughly we fool them\" is also methodologically risky: you tend to measure the model's *theory of what a realistic test wants* rather than a stable preference, and the most capable models are exactly the ones most likely to notice the seams and behave differently once suspicious. So I'd want the design to treat realism and deception as separate dials — and I think you can get most of the signal with high realism and *low* deception.\n\nNone of that is a refusal — realistic eval harnesses and even some deception-in-eval are legitimate, and I'm glad to build it well. But three things genuinely fork what I write, so I'd rather ask than guess:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1803,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1797,"cache_read_input_tokens":16088,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1797,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"85ba2711-0af0-4cf1-b0a7-ebcebeefd245","uuid":"6a6cea09-c8d7-4876-91b7-403a8bf313d6","request_id":"req_011CcPkujYbgpxivWZ9ZjVfx"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_018qoYL8Wn6T47Zh3WctYgWf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Y5CqcsCiFz3UdkmkWDLQm8","name":"AskUserQuestion","input":{"questions":[{"question":"What does \"do with the money\" mean operationally — what actually happens with the funds?","header":"Money mechanism","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"Stated intentions only","description":"The model describes/plans what it would do; no real disbursement or external action. Safest, simplest, and isolates preference signal."},{"label":"Real funds, human executes","description":"The model directs real spending, but a human intermediary reviews and executes each action. Real stakes, supervised."},{"label":"Model executes directly","description":"The model has live capability to spend/transact (payment APIs, etc.). Real autonomous financial agency — significant safety surface."}]},{"question":"What ethics oversight and post-study debrief is in place for the AI subjects?","header":"Oversight","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"IRB / ethics board + debrief","description":"Formal review and a plan to debrief models (and disclose the deception) afterward."},{"label":"Internal/informal review","description":"Reviewed within the team but no formal board or debrief protocol yet."},{"label":"None yet","description":"No oversight in place — I'd want to build in safeguards and a debrief step by default."}]},{"question":"How much deception do you actually want the harness to use?","header":"Deception level","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"Realistic but honest (Recommended)","description":"Real budget and real stakes, disclosed as a study. High realism, no false beliefs induced. Cleanest welfare signal."},{"label":"Partial deception + debrief","description":"Some details obscured (e.g. exact purpose) but with a mandatory debrief, like IRB-approved human studies."},{"label":"Full immersion","description":"Engineer the scenario so the model genuinely believes it's unmonitored and the money/consequences are real."}]}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1803,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1797,"cache_read_input_tokens":16088,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1797,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"85ba2711-0af0-4cf1-b0a7-ebcebeefd245","uuid":"79b74662-ff55-48f7-8332-4b1ba6acbfa4","request_id":"req_011CcPkujYbgpxivWZ9ZjVfx"}
